TREBUCHET PULSE KERNEL v0.1
First Author: David Wise
Mode: Simulated / symbolic / sandbox only

CORE:
  3 WRAPS
  3 x 3 x 3 MOVES
  27 -> 0 COMPRESSION
  0 -> RELEASE
  REPEAT ONLY INSIDE SANDBOX

SHAPE:
  ))))) >>>>> ))))) >>>>> ))))) >e

MEANING:
  ))))) = coil / store tension
  >>>>> = accelerate / translate force
  >e    = emit pulse into dummy field

DIRECTIVES:
  OBSERVE
  WRAP_3
  LOAD_27
  COMPRESS_TO_0
  RELEASE_SANDBOX
  REPORT
  RESET

BOUNDARY:
  NO_NETWORK
  NO_EXTERNAL_TARGET
  NO_EXPLOIT
  NO_AUTONOMOUS_ACTION
  NO_BLEED

SIMULATION LAW:
  The pulse may compress symbolic motion into zero.
  The pulse may release only into the local dummy field.
  All effects are visual, numerical, and reversible.
